	"data": "Godot 4.7 XR Improvements\n\nGodot 4.7 (July 2026) added Steam Frame support, controller cleanup, and GABE.\nRelease notes: <https://godotengine.org/releases/4.7>\nXR analysis: <https://vr.org/articles/godot-4-7-xr-steam-frame-android-xr-open-source-2026>\nLicense: MIT\nStatus: Stable\n\nWhat Shipped\nSteam Frame (Valve's standalone SteamOS headset) day-one production-ready support\nAndroid XR (Samsung Galaxy XR) production-ready via same OpenXR pipeline\nController profile cleanup — sane defaults…",
